			"width": 194.19351196289062,
			"height": 171.6,
			"strokeColor": "#a371f7",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "🔍 [tool.mypy]  — Type Checker\n\npython_version = \"3.10\"\n\n▸ ignore_missing_imports ✅\n  (llm-sdk has no stubs)\n\n▸ warn_return_any ⚠️\n  no implicit \"Any\" returns\n\n▸ disallow_untyped_defs 🚫\n  every function must have\n  type annotations!",
			"fontSize": 11,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"id": "mypy-box",
			"roughness": 0,
